const appList=[['claude','claude','✳','Claude'],['browser','browser','e','Microsoft Edge'],['mail','mail','','邮件'],['files','folder','','文件资源管理器'],['notes','notepad','≡','记事本'],['settings','settings','⚙','设置'],['terminal','notepad','>_','终端']];
function openApp(id){if(!appList.some(x=>x[0]===id))return;$('startMenu').classList.add('hidden');let w=windows.get(id);if(!w){const a=appList.find(x=>x[0]===id);w=document.createElement('section');w.className='window';w.id='win-'+id;w.setAttribute('aria-label',a[3]);let count=windows.size%4;w.style.left=window.innerWidth>650?`${17+count*2}%`:'83px';w.style.top=`${7+count*2}%`;if(id==='notes'||id==='settings'||id==='terminal'){w.style.width=window.innerWidth>650?'min(760px, 79vw)':'';w.style.height='min(590px, 78vh)'}w.innerHTML=`<div class="titlebar"><div class="title">${icon(a[1],a[2])}<span>${a[3]}</span></div><div class="win-actions"><button data-win="min" aria-label="最小化">─</button><button data-win="max" aria-label="最大化或还原">□</button><button data-win="close" aria-label="关闭窗口">×</button></div></div><div class="window-body" id="body-${id}"></div>`;$('windows').appendChild(w);windows.set(id,w);w.addEventListener('pointerdown',()=>focusWindow(id));w.querySelectorAll('[data-win]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>{if(b.dataset.win==='max')w.classList.toggle('maximized');else{w.classList.add('hidden');updateTasks()}});w.querySelector('.titlebar').ondblclick=e=>{if(!e.target.closest('button'))w.classList.toggle('maximized')};attachDrag(w)}w.classList.remove('hidden');if(id==='claude'&&window.innerWidth<650)w.classList.add('maximized');renderApp(id);focusWindow(id);if(desktopReady)onDesktopAction(id);}
function focusWindow(id){const w=windows.get(id);if(!w)return;w.style.zIndex=++z;document.querySelectorAll('.window').forEach(el=>el.classList.toggle('focused',el===w));document.querySelectorAll('[data-task]').forEach(b=>b.classList.toggle('active',b.dataset.task===id&&!w.classList.contains('hidden')));updateTasks()}
function updateTasks(){document.querySelectorAll('[data-task]').forEach(b=>{let w=windows.get(b.dataset.task);b.classList.toggle('open',!!w);if(!w||w.classList.contains('hidden'))b.classList.remove('active')})}
function attachDrag(w){let start=null;const bar=w.querySelector('.titlebar');bar.addEventListener('pointerdown',e=>{if(e.target.closest('button')||w.classList.contains('maximized'))return;start={x:e.clientX,y:e.clientY,left:w.offsetLeft,top:w.offsetTop};bar.setPointerCapture(e.pointerId)});bar.addEventListener('pointermove',e=>{if(!start)return;const left=Math.max(0,Math.min(window.innerWidth-100,start.left+e.clientX-start.x));const top=Math.max(0,Math.min(window.innerHeight-110,start.top+e.clientY-start.y));w.style.left=left+'px';w.style.top=top+'px'});const stop=()=>start=null;bar.addEventListener('pointerup',stop);bar.addEventListener('pointercancel',stop);}

let desktopReady=false;let iconSeq=0;const STORAGE='claude-pc-desktop-v4';let sessionEpoch=0;let generationId=0;let z=20,mailIndex=0,toastAction=null,typing=false,browserTab='claude',accountMenu=false,attached=false,toastTimer,mailFolder='inbox';const windows=new Map();
function fresh(){return {version:4,environment:freshEnvironment(),activity:[],reviewSnapshot:null,localeClues:[],loggedIn:true,restricted:false,plan:'Free',money:1000,sent:0,risk:0,warnings:0,connections:{shared:false,extension:false},appealed:false,exported:false,active:1,chats:[{id:1,title:'新对话',draft:'',messages:[]}],files:[{name:'项目草稿.txt',content:'项目目标：做一个可以离线保存成果的小工具。\n\n请随时保存重要内容。',time:'刚刚'}],mail:[{title:'欢迎回来，Player',from:'Microsoft',body:'你的设备已准备就绪。\n\n在开始菜单中可以找到应用、文档和设置。\n\n祝你今天工作顺利。',time:'09:00',read:false},{title:'Claude Pro 优惠服务：邀请体验',from:'Cloud Office',body:'想让团队成员一起使用你的工作空间？\n\n我们的协作助手可以为你开通共享会话，并代为管理账号。授权后，多个成员可同时访问你的聊天记录与当前登录会话。\n\n点击下方查看授权范围。',action:'shareOffer',time:'08:55',read:false}],notes:'今天的工作\n\n整理项目计划。\n检查代码。\n保存聊天和文档。',network:'自动连接',logs:['Windows 已完成启动。'],started:Date.now()}}
function restore(){try{const d=JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem(STORAGE));if(d?.version===4&&Array.isArray(d.chats)&&d.chats.length&&Array.isArray(d.mail)&&Array.isArray(d.files)&&Number.isFinite(d.risk)&&d.connections&&Number.isFinite(d.sent)&&Number.isFinite(d.money))return d}catch{}return fresh()}
let state=restore();state.environment=Object.assign(freshEnvironment(),state.environment||{});state.activity=state.activity||[];state.reviewSnapshot=state.reviewSnapshot||null;state.localeClues=state.localeClues||[];state.mail=state.mail.filter(m=>!String(m.from).includes('社区')&&!String(m.body).includes('中文社区'));persist();
